# Downloaded PDFs are typically large / not meant for git history.
# Comment these two lines out if you specifically want to commit the PDFs
# themselves (e.g. as part of the assignment submission).
downloaded_pdfs/**/*.pdf
downloaded_pdfs/
downloaded_pdfs/**/*